💬 Chat Architecture Flow
Client → SignalR Hub → Backend Services → Redis (Presence/Caching) → Database
SignalR handles real-time communication
Redis ensures scalability & performance
Role-based message routing ensures secure communication flow
📦 Project Setup
1. Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/your-username/hr-management-system.git
2. Navigate to project
cd hr-management-system
3. Configure database

Update appsettings.json:

"ConnectionStrings": {
  "DefaultConnection": "your-sql-server-connection-string"
}
4. Run migrations
dotnet ef database update
5. Run the project
dotnet run
